<title>USA: BPA leaves power offers unchanged for Tuesday.</title>
<headline>BPA leaves power offers unchanged for Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bonneville Power Administration (BPA) left pre-scheduled power offers unchanged for Tuesday, the agency said Monday.</p>
<p>Tuesday prices for non-firm power for hours ending at 0600 and 2300 PT were unchanged at $9.50 for all deliveries, while prices for hours ending 0100-0500 and 2400 were steady at $9.00.</p>
<p>Firm power during off-peak hours on Tuesday was also unchanged at $9.00 per MWh.</p>
<p>((--Los Angeles bureau +1 213 955 6761))</p>
</text>
